    (showWiden = widerPreset && handler; showJump = lastTransition && handler) ·
    data: the axis header + the placed, selectable, colour-coded ticks. PLUS the
    P4 leaf contract reproduced from the FSMStateDiagram sibling: loading (skeleton
    rail), error (TSQueryError + retry), and the orthogonal connectivity axis
